OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor hits out over 'unfair'
OL,4,Arural funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council boss has criticised the
OL,7,Fgovernment over its funding and said
OL,8,Fauthorities in rural areas suffer due
OL,9,Fto an "ingrained unfairness".
OL,11,FHerefordshire Council's deputy leader
OL,12,FElissa Swinglehurst said the authority
OL,13,Fwas "not being sustainably funded"
OL,14,Fdespite the challenges it faced in
OL,15,Ftrying to provide services in a large,
OL,16,Fsparsely-populated county.
OL,18,FIt is battling with a budget gap of up
OL,19,Fto #30m for 2026-27 and is having to
OL,20,Fdeliver a large savings plan to balance
OL,21,Fits books.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
